  "title": "St. Jude’s Dream Home in California Receives Solar System Donation from Tigo Energy and Partners",
  "summary": "LOS GATOS, Calif., April, 2, 2026 — Tigo Energy, Inc. (NASDAQ: TYGO) (“Tigo” or “Company”), a leading provider of intelligent solar and energy software solutions, today announced that the Company has collaborated with solar industry partners to donate the solar system for the most recent St. Jude’s Dream Home in California’s Coachella Valley.",
